/*!
    \qmlmodule QtQuick.Studio.LogicHelper 1.0
    \title Qt Quick Studio Logic Helper QML Types
    \ingroup qmlmodules

    \brief Provides a set of helper types to make scripting application
    behavior easier for designers.

    A set of ready-made studio components are available for scripting
    application behavior in \QDS.

    The QML types can be imported into your application using the following
    import statements in your .qml file:

    \badcode
    import QtQuick.Studio.LogicHelper 1.0
    \endcode
*/
